{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Game Theme.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Game Theme.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"game theme game theme","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Game Theme.md","fileName":"Game Theme.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Game Theme","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 14:36\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Authored Game Narrative]] [[Play Design Elements]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Authored Game Narrative","Play Design Elements","Game Context","advancedgamedesign.pdf","agamedesignvocabulary.pdf","gamesdesignandplay.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Game Theme.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Game Theme.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"game theme game theme","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Game Theme.md","fileName":"Game Theme.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Game Theme","heading":"Game Theme","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Game theme is what the player-facing experience means or is about. It is the outward expression of the game's underlying architecture, conveyed through fiction, art, sound, tokens, rules, and interaction.\n\nTheme is strongest when each system and token derives meaning from it and supports the same whole. Elements that contradict the theme should be changed or removed rather than treated as disconnected decoration.\n\nImages, animation, words, sound, and timing give rules a [[Game Context|context]] through which theme can be understood. When that context and the underlying mechanics behave coherently, the theme helps players form reliable expectations as well as interpretive meaning.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Authored Game Narrative","Play Design Elements","Game Context","advancedgamedesign.pdf","agamedesignvocabulary.pdf","gamesdesignandplay.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Game Theme.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Game Theme.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"game theme game theme","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Game Theme.md","fileName":"Game Theme.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Game Theme","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[advancedgamedesign.pdf]]\n[[agamedesignvocabulary.pdf]]\n[[gamesdesignandplay.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Authored Game Narrative","Play Design Elements","Game Context","advancedgamedesign.pdf","agamedesignvocabulary.pdf","gamesdesignandplay.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}